Winston hood grit: [speed=0.7][font_size=60]The WONDROUS [color="B80006"]Abdullah[/color].[/font_size] [font_size=50][wave freq=7 amp=30 connected=0]Glorious[/wave] Knight of Smithing.[/font_size] [font_size=40][wave freq=7 amp=30 connected=0]Heart[/wave] of the Bay Leaf Palace. [i]Pride of Kuva.[/i][/font_size]
